            "detailed_description": "<h1>Steam Workshop</h1><p>Submit items to the game and earn sales revenue!</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disco Dodgeball combines the physics-based projectile combat of dodgeball with flowing skateboard-style movement to create a fast-paced, skillful arena shooter unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against computer-controlled bots or online opponents in laser light-filled arenas that react dynamically to the music (whether it's from the built-in soundtrack or external media players).   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat uses real physics - you can dodge, deflect, and catch enemy shots like real dodgeball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ridiculous aerial stunt shots  like 360 helicopters and mid-air catches to rack up big points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of different game modes &amp; solo/co-op challenges to test your skills and teamwork - like Hoops, Grand Prix racing, Capture the Cube, and of course classic Elimination. Or you can create, share, and download custom game modes with in-game rule editor and Workshop support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline singleplayer challenges, bot matches (against highly skilled computer opponents that will team up against you), and randomized Arcade mode (where you battle waves of bots &amp; bosses using clever combinations of superpowered perks) give you plenty to do outside of online matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Level Editor lets you create the dance club / skate park of your dreams - then play it online with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer uses Steam Networking for optimal connection speeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen Local Multiplayer PvP and co-op challenges with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic hats, robot bodies, heads, wheels, decals, sunglasses, moustaches, and ball FX that can be crafted or earned from random in-game drops </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups like Jetpacks, Huge Dodgeballs, Laser Balls, and Boomerang Balls. Pick them up randomly or enable as permanent arena modifiers.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: This game contains lots of flashing lights. You can enable photosensitive mode in options / video. This will disable lasers, bright explosions and other lights that pulse to the beat of the music.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disco Dodgeball combines the physics-based projectile combat of dodgeball with flowing skateboard-style movement to create a fast-paced, skillful arena shooter unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against computer-controlled bots or online opponents in laser light-filled arenas that react dynamically to the music (whether it's from the built-in soundtrack or external media players).   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat uses real physics - you can dodge, deflect, and catch enemy shots like real dodgeball.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform ridiculous aerial stunt shots  like 360 helicopters and mid-air catches to rack up big points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of different game modes &amp; solo/co-op challenges to test your skills and teamwork - like Hoops, Grand Prix racing, Capture the Cube, and of course classic Elimination. Or you can create, share, and download custom game modes with in-game rule editor and Workshop support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline singleplayer challenges, bot matches (against highly skilled computer opponents that will team up against you), and randomized Arcade mode (where you battle waves of bots &amp; bosses using clever combinations of superpowered perks) give you plenty to do outside of online matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Level Editor lets you create the dance club / skate park of your dreams - then play it online with friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer uses Steam Networking for optimal connection speeds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen Local Multiplayer PvP and co-op challenges with up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic hats, robot bodies, heads, wheels, decals, sunglasses, moustaches, and ball FX that can be crafted or earned from random in-game drops </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerups like Jetpacks, Huge Dodgeballs, Laser Balls, and Boomerang Balls. Pick them up randomly or enable as permanent arena modifiers.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: This game contains lots of flashing lights. You can enable photosensitive mode in options / video. This will disable lasers, bright explosions and other lights that pulse to the beat of the music.</p>",
            "short_description": "A futuresport FPS where you race around a skate park / dance club and nail each other with dodgeball trick shots",
